hrough Manufacturing, Plantation, and Trading segments. It provides services for printed circuit board assembly; and complete box-build services to original equipment manufacturing companies. The company is also involved in the manufacturing and assembling of electronic; cultivation of oil palm; wholesale, trading, and dealing of various electrical and electronics products, and motor vehicles; and property investment, as well as provision of dormitory accommodation and services. The company was founded in 1991 and is based in Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia.","zh":"Scope Industries Berhad 是一家投资控股公司，在马来西亚和台湾制造及组装电气与电子元件和产品。公司成立于1991年，总部位于马来西亚吉隆坡，业务涵盖制造、种植和贸易三个板块。","lines":["制造：提供印刷电路板组装服务，并为原始设备制造商提供完整的整机组装（box-build）服务，同时制造和组装电子产品。","种植：从事油棕种植。","贸易：批发、贸易和经销各类电气与电子产品以及机动车辆。","物业与住宿：进行物业投资，并提供宿舍住宿及相关服务。"],"lines_en":["Manufacturing: provides printed circuit board assembly services and complete box-build services to original equipment manufacturers, and manufactures and assembles electronic products.","Plantation: engages in oil palm cultivation.","Trading: wholesales, trades, and deals in various electrical and electronics products and motor vehicles.","Property and accommodation: involves in property investment and provides dormitory accommodation and services."]}}